		{"id":"343a8453d86f733f","type":"text","text":"Punkte im Level an denen vertiefender Dialog mit den Seelen möglich wird","x":1498,"y":-1199,"width":250,"height":85},
		{"id":"99be6d23395ea61e","type":"text","text":"Ugrades im Level??","x":1498,"y":-1092,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ae192a5a8f11b79b","type":"text","text":"Bonfire Punkte Heilung / Artefakte ändern","x":1498,"y":-1012,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c16802bb3bce83ff","type":"text","text":"Geheime Kammern in Level?","x":1498,"y":-932,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"15c40ef6e7e40078","type":"text","text":"Setting: Düsterer, nebeliger Steg. Pro Seele ein Steg? Nebeneinander aufgereiht? Mit jeweils Stein-Statuen der Seelen die man begleitet. Wenn man das jew. Level abgeschlossen hat verändert sich etwas an ihnen (Leuchten)","x":996,"y":-1745,"width":502,"height":115},
		{"id":"6c753d68b72c354f","type":"text","text":"Beginn der Reise bzw. Einstieg ins Level","x":563,"y":-1718,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f08d2ae95fa3d9f8","type":"text","text":"Level","x":563,"y":-1462,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b6067a39e598fc7a","type":"text","text":"Mehrere Dungeons??","x":563,"y":-1258,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d0c694b15d21c0a2","type":"text","text":"Pause-Punkte","x":738,"y":-1062,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"812504f6c3432b19","type":"text","text":"Aktivität mit Seele: DMG etc.","x":-716,"y":-1294,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1bf7c9476d21745c","type":"text","text":"Special Attacken / Buffs\n\n- Range Attacke\n- Teleportation\n- Dodge Mechaniken\n- Wände hochklettern\n- Gravitation umkehren\n- Fliegen","x":-364,"y":-969,"width":250,"height":232},
		{"id":"ea3d25931a16503f","type":"text","text":"Seelen wegstoßen und herziehen und damit Gegnern Schaden zufügen","x":-364,"y":-1074,"width":250,"height":85},
		{"id":"69ace5da2a0de524","type":"text","text":"Seele kann bei bestimmten Dingen helfen, zB Tipps geben wenn man nicht weiter kommt? ","x":-694,"y":-1093,"width":206,"height":145},
		{"id":"2775785ab62af9df","type":"text","text":"Je nach Beziehung und Charakter unterschiedlich. Auch falsch-Aussagen mgl","x":-716,"y":-853,"width":250,"height":85},
